@startuml HLRQ-16-sdr-decomposition
' Dekompozicija sposobnosti — što je dijeljeno, a što specijalizirano.
' Gledište: struktura. Publika: implementator, arhitekt.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13) — izvor su HLRQ-16 §4a i NFRQ-ORG-08.
' Teza dijagrama: NIJEDNA klasa ne postoji po proizvođaču ni po modelu uređaja.
title HLRQ-16 — Decomposition: what is shared, what is specialised

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "wattleflow-workflow (concrete/) — zero-trust" #F4F4F4 {
  abstract class GenericConnection {
    +connect() : Generator
    +disconnect()
    +state : ConnectionState
  }
  abstract class GenericDriver {
    +read(uri, **kwargs)
    +write(uri, **kwargs)
    +state : DriverState
  }
  abstract class GenericParser {
    +deserialise(reader, **opts) : object
  }
  abstract class GenericFormatter {
    +serialise(content, **opts) : bytes
  }
}

package "blackwattle — jedan par po PRISTUPNOM MEHANIZMU" #FFF8E1 {

  class ConnectionSdrDevice {
    .. selektor (BR-02) ..
    +resolve() : DeviceHandle
    .. zauzeće (BR-03) ..
    +claim()
    .. ispitivanje (BR-11) ..
    +capabilities() : DeviceCapabilities
    .. parametri (BR-04, BR-05) ..
    +apply(params) : EffectiveParams
    .. smjer (BR-12) ..
    +mode : DeviceMode
  }

  class DriverSdrDevice {
    +read(uri, **kwargs) : Generator<SampleBlock>
    +write(uri, **kwargs) : str
  }

  class IqParser <<helper>> {
    +deserialise(reader, **opts) : SampleBlock
  }
  class IqFormatter <<helper>> {
    +serialise(content, **opts) : bytes
  }

  class DeviceCapabilities <<value>> {
    +gain_stages : Map<str, Range>
    +sample_rates : RangeList
    +freq_range : RangeList
    +antennas : List<str>
    +native_format : str
    +full_scale : float
    +directions : Set<Direction>
  }
  class SampleBlock <<value>> {
    +samples
    +sequence_no, started_at
    +effective_rate, centre_freq
    +format, full_scale
    +lost_before : int
  }
  enum DeviceMode {
    Receive
    Transmit
  }
}

GenericConnection <|-- ConnectionSdrDevice
GenericDriver     <|-- DriverSdrDevice
GenericParser     <|-- IqParser
GenericFormatter  <|-- IqFormatter

ConnectionSdrDevice --> DeviceCapabilities : ispituje\n(ne nosi tablicu)
ConnectionSdrDevice --> DeviceMode         : poluduplex\nstanje
DriverSdrDevice     --> ConnectionSdrDevice : koristi
DriverSdrDevice     ..> IqParser            : read — parser bira\nFACTORY po native_format
DriverSdrDevice     ..> IqFormatter         : write — samo gdje\ndirections sadrži Transmit
DriverSdrDevice     --> SampleBlock         : isporučuje

note right of DriverSdrDevice
  **read je JEDAN kod za sve uređaje.**
  Razlika među uređajima ulazi kroz
  DeviceCapabilities (vrijednosti) i kroz
  parser koji tvornica vrati za ispitani
  format — ne kroz granu po uređaju.
  (NFRQ-ORG-08 k.2)
end note

note bottom of IqFormatter
  **write je drugi ugovor** (BR-12):
  drugi protokol, poluduplex stanje,
  i ovlast (NFRQ-SEC-07).
  Zato se NE spaja s read putanjom —
  spajanje bi bilo regresija
  (NFRQ-ORG-08 k.4).
end note

note as N1 #FFCDD2
  **Nema klase po proizvođaču.**
  RTL2832U/R820T i HackRF One koriste
  ISTE klase; razlikuju se u vrijednostima
  koje ispitivanje vrati i u tome sadrže li
  directions Transmit.
  Nova klasa tek na promjenu ugovora
  ili mehanizma (DR-PRC-003 t.5).
end note
N1 .. ConnectionSdrDevice

@enduml
